<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Football Match Centre — System Tour</title><style>
:root{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#281b35;background:#f5f2f8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}.intro{padding:42px max(22px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2));background:#21182f;color:#fff;border-bottom:5px solid #c8f365}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#c8f365;font-weight:700}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:12px 0}.intro p{line-height:1.7;max-width:780px;color:#dcd4e8;margin:0}.intro a{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;background:#c8f365;color:#21182f;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 19px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:700}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px;max-width:1224px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 22px}.card{min-width:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2d9eb;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px #281b3506}.card header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}.card h2{margin:0;font-size:20px}.number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:35px;height:35px;border-radius:9px;background:#eee5f6;color:#62398c;font-weight:700}.card>p{color:#67596f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;min-height:145px}.shot{display:block;width:100%;height:470px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;border:1px solid #e7e0ed;border-radius:10px;cursor:zoom-in;background:#f6f4f8}.shot img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center}.card .hint{min-height:0;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:0}.notes{max-width:1180px;margin:25px auto 40px;padding:22px;background:#ede6f5;border-radius:14px;color:#574765;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.notes h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px}.notes p{margin:7px 0}dialog{width:min(95vw,650px);max-height:94vh;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:13px;background:#fff;color:#281b35}dialog::backdrop{background:#130e1bdd}dialog header{position:sticky;top:0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:13px 16px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2d9eb}dialog button{min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#ede6f5;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}dialog img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9454c8;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:1000px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:0 15px}.intro{padding:30px 22px}.card>p{min-height:0}.notes{margin:20px 15px}.shot{height:510px}}@media print{.intro{background:#fff;color:#281b35}.intro p{color:#574765}.intro a,.hint{display:none}.grid{display:block}.card{break-inside:avoid;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:none}.shot{height:auto;overflow:visible}.shot img{height:auto}.card>p{min-height:0}}
</style></head><body><header class="intro"><div class="eyebrow">FOOTBALL MATCH CENTRE · SCREENSHOT WALKTHROUGH</div><h1>What the system presents</h1><p>Six screens from the dashboard, captured on 6 October 2026. These screenshots use the current browser layout. They are saved snapshots; the dashboard itself can refresh its connected feeds.</p><a href="/football">Open the dashboard ↗</a></header><main class="grid"><article class="card"><header><span class="number">01</span><h2>Overview</h2></header><p>A stadium-inspired home screen with five league choices, the current matchweek, upcoming matches and recent results. The win probabilities shown here are demo estimates.</p><button class="shot" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Overview screenshot" onclick="showShot(this)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Overview screen captured from the football dashboard" loading="lazy" width="388" height="1140"></button><p class="hint">Select the screenshot to view it in full.</p></article>
<article class="card"><header><span class="number">02</span><h2>Fixtures &amp; results</h2></header><p>Matchweek 6 is the current default. Club crests, dates and Jordan kick-off times make the schedule easy to scan. Club filters and the match details button help viewers find their team.</p><button class="shot" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Fixtures &amp; results screenshot" onclick="showShot(this)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Fixtures &amp; results screen captured from the football dashboard" loading="lazy" width="388" height="1140"></button><p class="hint">Select the screenshot to view it in full.</p></article>
<article class="card"><header><span class="number">03</span><h2>View Goal</h2></header><p>The mural is hidden on this screen. It opens at the latest round with scored goals (Matchweek 5 in this capture), with a Matchday 6 shortcut. Each club has its own scorer list, goal minutes and the score after each goal. Match-specific clips and Fantasy stats sit beside one another.</p><button class="shot" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge View Goal screenshot" onclick="showShot(this)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="View Goal screen captured from the football dashboard" loading="lazy" width="388" height="1140"></button><p class="hint">Select the screenshot to view it in full.</p></article>
<article class="card"><header><span class="number">04</span><h2>League standings</h2></header><p>The table presents club positions, matches played, results, goals and points. Club badges and a highlighted leader make it easier to read. On small screens, swipe across the table to see the remaining statistics.</p><button class="shot" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge League standings screenshot" onclick="showShot(this)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="League standings screen captured from the football dashboard" loading="lazy" width="388" height="1140"></button><p class="hint">Select the screenshot to view it in full.</p></article>
<article class="card"><header><span class="number">05</span><h2>Top scorers</h2></header><p>A featured leading scorer is followed by the player rankings, club badges, goal totals and available assist/minute statistics. Player photos are shown when the source provides them.</p><button class="shot" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Top scorers screenshot" onclick="showShot(this)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Top scorers screen captured from the football dashboard" loading="lazy" width="388" height="1140"></button><p class="hint">Select the screenshot to view it in full.</p></article>
<article class="card"><header><span class="number">06</span><h2>Team coaches</h2></header><p>The new Coaches option shows the coach alongside the club, with a portrait, nationality, age and appointment date where available. Viewers can search by coach or club, refresh the listing and open the official profile.</p><button class="shot" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Team coaches screenshot" onclick="showShot(this)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Team coaches screen captured from the football dashboard" loading="lazy" width="388" height="1140"></button><p class="hint">Select the screenshot to view it in full.</p></article></main><aside class="notes"><h2>Other features already presented</h2><p>Match details include stadium information, separate home and away goal lists, a formation view with player photos and a substitutes bench with player positions. Fantasy picks provide a shortlist using the connected FPL player and fixture data.</p><p>Coach names are connected across all five leagues. Sources without portraits use initials, and unavailable dates are omitted. Official coach feeds are cached for up to six hours.</p><p>Activity records local dashboard actions. Cloud simulation shows clearly labelled demo metrics. Data sources and update times are shown in the dashboard; clip and league-data availability depend on the provider.</p></aside><dialog id="viewer"><header><strong id="viewerTitle">Screenshot</strong><button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('viewer').close()">Close</button></header><img id="viewerImage" alt=""></dialog><script>function showShot(button){const image=button.querySelector('img');document.getElementById('viewerImage').src=image.dataset.full||image.src;document.getElementById('viewerImage').alt=image.alt;document.getElementById('viewerTitle').textContent=button.closest('article').querySelector('h2').textContent;document.getElementById('viewer').showModal()}document.getElementById('viewer').addEventListener('click',function(event){if(event.target===this)this.close()})</script></body></html>